      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUNSET VANADIUM (1) sailed across from an outside draw and gave a sight, holding on for second and beaten a nose (22.86) at this track in a Grade 6 over 400m. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. One of the leading chances. SIX STORY SYD (2) pinged the lids from out wide but run ended and faded out of it late when 6th at this track in Grade 5/6 company. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Key runner on best form. MAN ABOUT TOWN (7) stalked lead from an outside box last start before finishing third (23.12) at this track in a Grade 6 over 400m. Expected to be in this for a long way. CHICKEN FISH (8) was strongly fancied last time but ran below expectations when sixth (30.54), beaten 8 lengths. Comes through a solid form race last start.",
